Description: Weather announcement system for AllStarLink amateur radio
 ASL Weather Announce is a Python-based weather announcement system
 for AllStarLink v3 (ASLv3) amateur radio networks. It fetches
 current weather conditions and broadcasts spoken weather reports
 through ASL nodes using text-to-speech.
 .
 Features:
  - Dual Location Support: Look up locations by postal/ZIP code or
    specify exact latitude/longitude coordinates
  - Free Weather Data: Uses Open-Meteo API (no API key required)
  - Smart Geocoding: Multi-service postal code lookup with
    automatic failover
  - TTS-Optimized Output: Natural language weather descriptions
    designed for speech synthesis
  - Time & Date Announcements: Optional current time and date
    announcements with timezone support
  - Persistent Caching: Disk-based caching for location lookups
  - Flexible Configuration: INI file configuration with CLI override
    support
